RELAXED_BOX 71.7787844263352 71.7883414749834 71.7759683334746

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-310.082738018122)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-310.082738018122)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
variable d2 equal -(v_pyy1-${pyy0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d2 equal -(v_pyy1-105.115517843505)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d2 equal -(v_pyy1-105.115517843505)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
